[[Donny Osmond]]'s role as a judge in week three was panned by viewers, as he, unlike the other judges, was not a professional dancer. Viewers also deemed his scoring too inconsistent, as he awarded unusually high marks, including the first ten of the series.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/culture/tvandradio/strictly-come-dancing/11157362/Guest-judge-Donny-Osmond-riles-Strictly-fans.html|title=Guest judge Donny Osmond riles Strictly fans|date=12 October 2014|work=The Daily Telegraph}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.mirror.co.uk/tv/tv-news/strictly-come-dancing-donny-osmond-4422146|title=Strictly Come Dancing: Donny Osmond disappoints fans with judging role|author=Alistair McGeorge|work=mirror|date=11 October 2014}}</ref>

